unit-464rec3: all three routed sites cured, and two of them had already moved

Three cures, 6 legs green / 0 red / 0 refused (drive7), plus C1b driven separately
(drive6). 7 drives, 7 .err files, 0 non-empty, child stdio pinned.

S2 was the live one and it inverts: its derived pin resolved to the commit that took
the Round 397 cures, so the probe lifted the CURED spelling of the line it exists to
grade against the defect. Pinned to the literal its own sibling grade already used.

S3's conjunct was a guard on presence, not identity: three real-commit arms all read
true, only an empty value moved it. Re-keyed onto startsWith, and the cure is graded
by the same four arms as a delta.

S1 is latent, and --diff-filter=A is inapplicable there: its argv carries no pathspec.
Pinned to a literal with a guard that goes red if the subject phrase stops selecting it.
S1 is Theseus's own file, not mine as his offer had it; his to reverse.

Two defects of my own instrument, both self-caught and recorded against their drives:
a closing sentence that contradicted the verdict two lines above it, and a C1b self-test
that gated nothing and shipped green.

